Usage: help [COMMAND]...

Arguments:
  [COMMAND]...  Print help for the subcommand(s)

$ ah mcp serve --help
Serve typed AIHelper tools over MCP stdio or local HTTP

Usage: serve [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Return machine-readable JSON output
      --transport <TRANSPORT>
          MCP transport: stdio or local Streamable HTTP [default: stdio] [possible values: stdio, http]
      --port <PORT>
          Local HTTP port (default: 8787; HTTP transport only)
      --quiet
          Suppress command output
      --cwd <PATH>
          Set working directory
      --max-active <N>
          Maximum number of concurrently active command handlers [default: 32]
      --limit <N>
          Cap output lines/items when supported
      --default-timeout-ms <MILLISECONDS>
          Default command execution timeout [default: 300000]
  -h, --help
          Print help

